<img
src ="img/Polittico.jpg" style="height: 530px; width: auto;">

//“So, the great George sent you to learn precision?" a voice echoes. It’s the Archangel Michael. "Look little guardian, what I learned in fighting with the devil everytime is that the difference between us and him stands in the little things. Every detail can hide or show something else. To help you better understand this concept, show me if you can find the figures I’m talking about with a little description.//


[[Start the minigame ->Challenge_1]]



:: \ Archangel Michael again {"position":"1950,625","size":"100,100"}
It’s Archangel Michael, his voice booms from your device and tells you to continue to room 15 until you find him. 

"//The monster has broken the vertical axis with my pitchfork, help me, so you can finally have the other sword that I hold//!” 

[[Continue to room 15 and find another Archangel Michael ->Madonna col Bambino in gloria e i Santi Michele Arcangelo, Pietro e Benedetto]]





:: \ Challenge_3 {"position":"2700,475","size":"100,100"}
To save the painting, you must put all your energy as a mortal young human in that flower.

''Press the finger firmly upon the lily and hold it''''!'' ''Do not break the focus! Hold it as long and as powerfully as you can, until the life force flows back into every brushstroke and the canvas is whole again. ''


<img
src ="img/Pala_Manzuoli_fiore.png">



|button>[Loading energy... Something will appear soon...]
(live: 20s)[
  (replace: ?button)[
    (link-goto: "Perfect, you've brought the painting back to life!", "Instructions to the next step")
  ]
  (stop:)
]


