:: \ First instruction\  {"position":"1350,225","size":"100,100"}
Once configured, the app tells you to head to the ''//Saint George and the dragon//'' painting to start the mission.

[[Go to Saint George and the dragon -> san giorgio presentation]] 



:: \ First overview of the game {"position":"1150,225","size":"100,100"}
After downloading the app a message appears: 

<img
src ="img/Welcome.png" style= "height: auto; width: auto;">

(align:"=><=")+(box:"X")[//''Welcome to A A Very Hery Holy Mess''//]
You quickly breeze through the initial setup: selecting the language, adjusting audio settings, and choosing the difficulty level. Then you can decide whether to play at the museum or at home. 

<center>
<img
src ="img/Location.png" style= "height: auto; width: auto;">
</center>

[[Choose the museum -> First instruction ]]



:: \ Goodbye? {"position":"2925,1150","size":"100,100"}
(align:"<==")+(box:"=XX=")[''Well done, warrior; our journey ends here, but do not worry, new adventures await us...'']

[[Play again -> Guard Museum ]]


:: \ Gozzadini's family {"position":"1850,925","size":"100,100"}
You approach the ''Gozzadini portrait'', from which you hear a voice talk to you about the magnificent city where you are.

<center>
<img
src ="img/Famiglia_Gozzadini.jpg">
</center>

//“Do we have a newcomer in town? Or perhaps you already know us? I am Ulisse Gozzadini, and this is my family. For centuries, we have brought greatness to this city; and to affirm the strength of our dynasty, as well as for reasons of inheritance, the great painter Lavinia Fontana has immortalized us here”// 


[[Start the challenge ->challenge_6]]



:: \ Guard Museum\  {"position":"200,200","size":"100,100"}
"Welcome to the museum," the guard says listing the usual rules: no running, no noise, and no touching. Behind him, a vibrant ad invites visitors to download an interactive game app. What to do now?


[[Download the app and play at the museum-> First overview of the game]] 
[[Play later at home->Play at home]]


:: \ Instructions Michele {"position":"2350,225","size":"100,100"}
{(set: $found_well to false)
(set: $found_dante to false)}
//"I knew you were a brave boy, but that’s only a start of all the story. Go now to the grand vision of 'Heaven and Hell'. The underworld is a maze of suffering and deceit. I need you to document the exact torments of the damned so we may understand our enemy's cruelty. Look closely at the painting, and find what I seek”//

[[Go to the painting->Challenge_2]]



:: \ Latona transforming the Sheperds into Frogs {"position":"2325,1150","size":"100,100"}
Latona stands by the edge of the pond, gazing at the transformed landscape, and declares: //My story is told in the sixth book of Ovid’s *Metamorphoses*, a work that may be considered the greatest encyclopedia of transformation in the ancient world. Help me find the six "men" hidden in this scene and I will grant your blade a new life and extraordinary power, enabling you to slay the dragon once and for all.//


<img src ="img/Sei_rane.png"> 



[[Excellent, you have completed the challenge ->The quest is finally completed]]



:: \ Pala Bargellini {"position":"2200,900","size":"100,100"}
<img src ="img/Zoom_torri.png">


The two towers in the background serve as a symbolic landmark, anchoring the sacred scene to the city of Bologna.

[[Go back to find another detail ->challenge_6]]


:: \ Pala Manzuoli {"position":"2750,625","size":"100,100"}
You find the majestic painting. 

<img
src ="img/Pala_Manzuoli.jpg">

There, near Mother Mary, Saint George stands in his gleaming armor, exactly as he described. But you notice that the painting is disappearing, the canvas is almost ruined. Following the instructions, your eyes drop to the bottom center of the painting, where stands an angel with hands clasped in devotion. Saint George whispers through your device. 
"//Usually, the angels at the foot of the throne play instruments, but this one offers something far more precious: absolute silence and the White Lily, the ultimate symbol of purity. In fact he is positioned exactly under the major figure of this painting, the Holy Mary. However the lily is not just that, it also represents the beating heart of this masterpiece//," 

[[Start the challenge -> Challenge_3]]




:: \ Pala scarani, Madonna con bambino in gloria  e i santi michele arcangelo, caterina d’alessandria, apollonia e giovanni evangelista {"position":"2350,625","size":"100,100"}
(set: $cherubs to 0)

<center>
<img
src ="img/Pala_Scarani.jpg">
</center>

//Here, brute strength is not enough//, a voice says softly. //I am Catherine of Alexandria. I defeated the emperor's scholars with my mind, now it’s your turn to use your intellect to help me. As you may see, little guardian, this masterpiece is a triumph of Renaissance balance. The painting is clearly divided into two halves: the earthly world below, where the saints stand, and the divine world above, populated by a choir of cherubims. What’s going on now? Do you feel that too? It’s like an earthquake…Come here, faster//”


[[What is happening?->Challenge_4]]


:: \ Premio {"position":"1475,475","size":"100,100"}
The puzzle is solved, and the heavens bestow their favor. You have received the Archangel's blade—deliver it to Saint George to prepare him for the final strike! Go back to section 1 and pass to //Saint George and the dragon// again, he needs you!

[[Give the new weapon to Saint George -> Rest?]] 


:: \ Rest? {"position":"1500,725","size":"100,100"}
The solemn voice of your lord speaks to you: 
//Thank you, guardian, but something is missing in this sword...I hear heavy footsteps echoing in the gallery. The dragon is searching for me, I need a safe refuge where to rest and recover my strenght. Somewhere holy, somewhere quiet, somewhere far from fire I don’t know where to go, help me please//

[[Find a refuge for Saint George ->hideandseek]] 


:: \ Rest?# {"position":"1075,3750","size":"100,100"}
The solemn voice of your lord speaks to you: 
//Thank you, guardian, but something is missing in this sword...I hear heavy footsteps echoing in the gallery. The dragon is searching for me, I need a safe refuge where to rest and recover my strenght. Somewhere holy, somewhere quiet, somewhere far from fire I don’t know where to go, help me please//

[[Find a refuge for Saint George ->hideandseek#]] 


:: \ San Giorgio {"position":"1550,225","size":"100,100"}
<video src="video/animated_saint_george.mp4" controls autoplay muted width="640" height="480"> </video>





//Seek out my celestial companion, the Archangel Michael, within Master Giotto’s great golden polyptych. Like me, he is battling a demon and will know what must be done. Will you lend us your aid, brave soul?//


[[Start to play and frame the Polittico -> Archangel Michael]]



:: \ San Girolamo {"position":"2175,750","size":"100,100"}
<img src ="img/Zoom_teschio.png">

The skull at the bottom serves as a *memento mori*, symbolizing the transience of life and the inevitability of death in contrast to the eternal spiritual experience depicted above.

[[Go back to find another detail ->challenge_6]]



:: \ Second section {"position":"2950,425","size":"100,100"}
You enter the Renaissance section. The massive presence of gold that characterized the backgrounds of the works in the first section is no longer present; instead, the skies are filled with angelic hosts that become an integral part of the narrative, acting as messengers, musicians, and guardians of the divine order. It’s time to find the other Saint George.


[[Find the other Saint George -> Pala Manzuoli]]



:: \ Vergine Annunziata {"position":"2075,1000","size":"100,100"}
<img src ="img/Vergine_Annunziata_zoom.png">


The book held by Mary symbolizes her devoutness and her contemplative state of mind, particularly in the context of the Annunciation, suggesting she was reading prophecies regarding the Messiah before the Angel Gabriel's arrival.

Press the button in the book

|button>[Something will appear soon...]
