:: Challenge_1 {"position":"1950,225","size":"100,100"}
''You need to use your fingers as a sword''. Trace the exact golden gothic outline of the panel you chose for that specif hint. You must be perfectly precise and steady. One mistake, and you must start over! 

//Find the old guard by the heavenly gate, Holding the keys to our mortal fate//  
(link: "Who is this character?")[ 
    (set: $target to "Saint Peter") 
    (goto: "Bridge")
]

//Look for the Mother in heavenly blue, Holding the Child so noble and true//
(link: "Who is this character?")[ 
    (set: $target to "Holy Mary") 
    (goto: "Bridge")
]

//Find the wise scholar in a mantle of red, With a book of truth and a blade to dread.//
(link: "Who is this character?")[ 
    (set: $target to "Saint Paul") 
    (goto: "Bridge")
]   

//Trace the fierce warrior with wings spread wide, Trampling the beast with nowhere to hide! //
(link: "Who is this character?")[ 
    (set: $target to "Archangel Michael") 
    (goto: "Bridge")
]    

//Seek my winged brother, gentle and bold, Holding a scroll where the truth is told// 
(link: "Who is this character?")[ 
    (set: $target to "Archangel Gabriel") 
    (goto: "Bridge") 
]


