:: Challenge_2 {"position":"2550,225","size":"100,100"}
<img src="img/Paradiso_Inferno.jpg" style="height: 530px; width: auto;">

//Welcome to my masterpiece, little mortal//, screams the devil in a powerful and unsettling voice, //my winged friend calls this a maze of suffering, but I call it... absolute justice. There are too many souls, but I can distinguish them since every torment you see is meticulously crafted and perfectly tailored to the sin it repays.  Let me see if you can do it too...//

(if: $found_well is false)[[Find the souls who earned the demon's heavy beat, and those who boil within the stone well's heat!->souls]]
(if: $found_well is true)[{''Great, you found the souls!''}]

(if: $found_dante is false)[[Look to your left, nestled among the seated saints in the central tier, find the silent poet, crowned in red, who wrote about the realms of the living and the dead.!->Dante]]
(if: $found_dante is true)[{''Great, you found Dante Alighieri, the italian poet famous for his masterpiece //La Divina Commedia// !''}]

(if: $found_well is true and $found_dante is true)

[[Excellent, you have completed the challenge->san giorgio again ]]


