:: Exit {"position":"1650,925","size":"100,100"}
The air in this section  feels heavier, you look for instructions or voices, but it’s just you and the silence of the gallery. You decide to keep walking and end up in Room 22.  
[[Go to room 22 -> Gozzadini's family]]



:: Exit# {"position":"1075,4075","size":"100,100"}
The air now feels heavier, you look for instructions or voices, but it’s just you and the silence of your livingroom. You decide to ask for a hint and the app suggests to talk with someone else: the Gozzardini's family.

[[Scan Gozzadini's family card->Gozzadini's family#]]



