//“Do we have a newcomer in town? Or perhaps you already know us? I am Ulisse Gozzadini, and this is my family. For centuries, we have brought greatness to this city; and to affirm the strength of our dynasty—as well as for reasons of inheritance—the great painter Lavinia Fontana has immortalized us here. Draw a challenge card, prove us we can trust you and show you the next painting”.//  

[[Draw a challenge card->challenge_6#]]



