:: Latona transforming the Sheperds into Frogs# {"position":"250,5500","size":"100,100"}
Latona stands by the edge of the pond, gazing at the transformed landscape, and declares: //My story is told in the sixth book of Ovid’s *Metamorphoses*, a work that may be considered the greatest encyclopedia of transformation in the ancient world. Help me find the six "men" hidden in this scene and I will grant your blade a new life and extraordinary power, enabling you to slay the dragon once and for all.//


 <img src ="img/Sei_rane.png"> 



[[Excellent, you have completed the challenge ->The quest is finally completed#]]



:: LatonaGame {"position":"2125,1150","size":"100,100"}
Even though the game has ended, the water used to quench the dog's thirst continues to swirl. Following its course, you notice the landscape changing: the vibrancy of the meadow gives way to a darker setting, dominated by fear and unease. You look around the room for a similar scene and find yourself facing *''Latona Transforming the Shepherds into Frogs''*. You try to frame it with the app and discover a woman gazing up at the sky.

<img src ="img/Latona.jpg">


[[Start the challenge -> Latona transforming the Sheperds into Frogs]]



:: LatonaGame# {"position":"250,5375","size":"100,100"}
