:: Pala Manzuoli# {"position":"625,2325","size":"100,100"}
You have crossed into a different zone, you loose 2 minutes.

You found the majestic painting. 

<center>
<img
src ="img/Pala_Manzuoli_card.png">
</center>
There is Saint George in his gleaming armor, exactly as he described. But you notice that the painting is disappearing, the canvas is almost ruined. Following the instructions, your eyes drop to the bottom center of the painting, where stands an angel with hands clasped in devotion. Saint George whispers through your device. 
"//Usually, the angels at the foot of the throne play instruments, but this one offers something far more precious: absolute silence and the White Lily, the ultimate symbol of purity. In fact he is positioned exactly under the major figure of this painting, the Holy Mary. However the lily is not just that, it also represents the beating heart of this masterpiece//," 

[[Start the challenge -> Challenge_3#]]




:: Pala scarani, Madonna con bambino in gloria  e i santi michele arcangelo, caterina d’alessandria, apollonia e giovanni evangelista# {"position":"900,2650","size":"100,100"}
(set: $cherubs to 0)

<center>
<img
src ="img/Pala_Scarani_card.png">
</center>
You scan the card and "Here, brute strength is not enough," a voice says softly. "I am Catherine of Alexandria. I defeated the emperor's scholars with my mind, now it’s your turn to use your intellect to help me. As you may see little guardian this masterpiece is a triumph of Renaissance balance. The painting is clearly divided into two halves: the earthly world below, where the saints stand, and the divine world above, populated by a choir of cherubims. What’s going on now? Do you feel that too? It’s like an earthquake…Come here, faster”" 


[[What is happening?->Challenge_4#]]


